@startuml U07_version_lifecycle_state
!include style.iuml
title U07 — Pathway version lifecycle (state machine, Sprint 2)

[*] --> Draft : POST /pathways\nor New draft (copy of latest)
Draft --> Draft : Save (PUT /versions/{id})
Draft --> Verified : Verify [report = SAFE]
Draft --> Draft : Verify [UNSAFE or TOO_LARGE]\n/ store report, Publish stays blocked
Verified --> Draft : Save (any edit)\n/ clear report
Verified --> Published : Publish (designer)
state Published : immutable: PUT and Publish → 409
Published --> Deployed : Deploy (admin, Sprint 4)
Deployed --> Draining : Undeploy\n/ no new cases
Draining --> Retired : last case finished\n/ stop engine container
Retired --> [*]
note right of Verified
  Verified always refers to this exact model:
  any edit returns the version to Draft (VER-01).
end note
note bottom of Published
  Implemented in Sprints 1–2: Draft, Verified, Published.
  Deployed, Draining, Retired arrive with the deployer (DEP-01/02).
end note
@enduml
